cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the accompanying manuscript and the software."
title: "Taylor-Informed Indirect Adaptive Predictive Control Using Jacobian-Frozen Affine Predictors: MATLAB Code"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Nguyen"
    given-names: "Tam W."
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tamwng/taylor-informed-iapc"
url: "https://github.com/tamwng/taylor-informed-iapc"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible MATLAB implementation of Taylor-informed indirect adaptive
  predictive control using recursive least squares, a forward-Euler-informed
  reduced polynomial dictionary, Jacobian-frozen affine predictors, and model
  predictive control for an RK4-simulated nonlinear plant.
keywords:
  - adaptive control
  - predictive control
  - recursive least squares
  - Taylor expansion
  - affine predictor
  - model predictive control
